record(case,'IRB Ganga: public concession, private equity and a related-party exit','A₹1,746crore lowest-grant award led to MBEL’s₹6,538crore financing plan. IRB retained EPC and O&M roles while GICaffiliate Anahera held49%. InDecember2024IRB Infrastructure Trust acquired80.4%of equity anddebentures for₹1,714.92crore combined consideration. This is a documented capital-recycling chain, not proof of a political favour.','investigation-case',['upeida-awards','irb-close','irb-gic','irb-related-party','irb-acquisition-close','cci-mbel','irb-toll','irb-ar25'],['upeida','irb','mbel','mbel-loan','anahera','gic','irbit','cci'],irb_edges,'Award16December2021;financial close16June2022;equity/EPCdisclosure19October2022;transfer27December2024;tolling17May2026','Read linked response: regulatory approval and issuer arm’s-length assertion are distinct; acquisition closed and tolling commenced. No public bill/payment ledger or seller-level consideration split was retrieved.',['An InvIT can recycle sponsor capital and spread construction/toll risks through disclosed approvals.','Foreign investment or related-party status alone does not establish undue influence.'],'Reconcile contract modifications, VGF releases, lender drawdowns, independent valuation, seller receipts and related-party EPC invoices; evidence of unfair valuation or undisclosed payments could change the assessment.',['UP'],[amount(1746,'selected VGF grant; release unverified','2021award'),amount(2659,'debt financing tied up','2022financial close'),amount(2133,'equity and related infusion commitment','2022financial close'),amount(1714.92,'closed combined equity-and-debenture acquisition consideration','27December2024')],asof='2026-05-17',start='2021-12-16',end='2026-05-17',limitations=['All four amounts measure different flows/stages; no combined spending total.','₹533.20crore completed first equity raise in2022is a component of financing, not additional project cost.','IRB annual-report debt figure includes pending disbursement.','Private IRB Infrastructure Trust and public IRB InvIT Fund remain separate.'])

